Package: creditPolicyTool
Title: Credit Policy Tool v2
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Vishnu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Credit risk policy discovery, simulation, and governance tool
    for consulting demos. Modular Shiny app built on bslib with a
    three-layer architecture (tabs, services, engine) and optional
    LLM integration for segment explanations and scenario narration.
